keting and Communications Assistant - Work Study Student Springfield Campus efactory-- Center for Business and Economic Development (CBED) Work with Marketing and Communications Director to create content for multiple platforms. This may include social media posting/engagement; blog writing; graphic design and email marketing. View Details Bookmark Student Worker - Volleyball Student Springfield Campus Intercollegiate Athletics Assist with games as a ball shagger. View Details Bookmark Student Worker - Men's and Women's Soccer Student Springfield Campus Intercollegiate Athletics To assist with game day and ball shaggingNo experience necessary View Details Bookmark Theatre & Dance Scenic Painters - Work Study Student Springfield Campus Theatre & Dance Seeking work study eligible students for scenic painting in the Department of Theatre and Dance. Position will include painting and prepping scenery and properties for theatrical productions within the Department of Theatre and Dance. Duties will include, but are not limited to, base painting, faux finishes, texturing, Tromp L’Oeil painting, sealing, sanding, finishing and tool maintenance (cle... View Details Bookmark Residence Life - Student Facilities Assistant - Custodial Student Springfield Campus Residence Life, Housing and Dining Services CustodialClean buildings, furnishings, carpet and upholstery within assigned areas to include dusting, mopping, vacuuming, sweeping, etc.Trash and recycling removalUse the proper cleaning agent for each assigned taskAssist with cleaning outdoor areas such as loading docks, verandas, etc.Other duties, as assignedMoving CrewAssist with delivery of supplies or equipment using hand trucks, carts, o... View Details Bookmark Theatre & Dance Front of House Student Assistant - Work Study Student Springfield Campus Theatre & Dance Ushers and front of house staff are responsible for the general ease and comfortability of our patrons that attend academic productions throughout the semester. Other duties include scanning tickets, handing out programs, assist with set up and take down of equipment.Ushers will be required to assist patrons to their seats, guide them to bathrooms, exit areas, and answer applicable questions to... View Details Bookmark ResNet Software Developer Student Springfield Campus Residence Life, Housing and Dining Services The primary duty of the ResNet Software Developer is to develop software to increase the quality of life of residents and staff of on-campus housing. Developers work as a team to resolve issues and implement features in new or existing applications. The Web Programmer Analyst assigns tasks and duties to the Software Developers as needed. View Details Bookmark Production Assistant - Work Study Student Springfield Campus Theatre & Dance The job of the Production Assistant is to assist the Executive Director in making sure the venue is ready for use by university colleges and outside rental groups.Job duties include:-Venue setup and installation for university events, concerts, and rentals.-Working as technician or usher for Amphitheatre rentals and events.-Maintenance, repairs, and organization of Amphitheatre equipment.-Maint... View Details Bookmark Switchboard Operator Student Springfield Campus Networking and Telecommunications Main campus switchboard for Missouri State University, the caller’s first contact with the university. Requires strict confidentiality. Answer calls from on- and off-campus for transfer to the appropriate area. Also may occasionally be asked to do other tasks.Must be responsible and demonstrate the ability to fluently speak and comprehend the English language. View Details Bookmark Library Information Student Assistant--work study required Student Springfield Campus Library Meyer Library’s Access Services Department is seeking out-going and detail-oriented student employees for the Library Information Desk. Library Information Student Assistants play a pivotal role in providing customer service as they welcome a diverse community of users and connect them to Library services and resources. Duties range from staffing the main information desk, lending library mater... View Details Bookmark Bear POWER Tutor Student Springfield Campus School of Special Education, Leadership and Professional Studies Are you passionate about empowering students to achieve academic success? Join our team as a Part-Time Academic Tutor for the Bear POWER program. This role focuses on assisting students with homework, studying for tests, and fostering their growth as independent learners. You’ll play a vital role in helping students build confidence, overcome challenges, and thrive academically.Provide one-on-o... View Details Bookmark Athletic & Entertainment Facilities - Student Custodial Student Springfield Campus GSB Arena Assist with preventative and planned custodial workAssist with restocking bathrooms with paper towels, soap, toilet paper, and other productsAssist with setting tables, chairs, and pipe and drape for eventsRemove and take out trash in facilitiesClean and mop floorsUnclog sinks, stools, and urinalsClean toilets, shower drains, and sinksEvaluate and track custodial needs and prioritize when neede... View Details Bookmark Audio Visual Tech (MULTIPLE OPENINGS) Student Springfield Campus Hammons Student Center Work in set-up, operation and tear down of equipment for special events (athletic & concerts)Regular schedule is limited and special event work opportunities are available. Holidays, late nights, & early morning shifts are a regular occurrence with the position. View Details Bookmark Customer Service - Work Study Student Springfield Campus School of Nursing Customer service for students, faculty, staff and visitors; answering phone; making copies; help with marketing promotional materials for School of Nursing events View Details Bookmark Event Usher (MULTIPLE OPENINGS) Student Springfield Campus GSB Arena Support service for event audience at Great